  END



  # Brace: spend n PCr to raise mitosis threshold (phosphagen CDK fortification).
  # Distinct from poise (PCr→lower thr), fortify (ATP→raise thr), harden (heat→raise thr),
  # prime (ATP→lower thr), ease (heat→lower thr), boost (PCr→energy), load (energy→PCr),
