  END



  # Drive: spend n pmf to lower mitosis threshold (chemiosmotic CDK priming / F1Fo-coupled gate open).
  # Distinct from prime (ATP→lower thr), poise (PCr→lower thr), ease (heat→lower thr),
  # fortify/brace/harden (raise thr), synthase (pmf→ATP), pump (energy→pmf), uncouple (pmf→heat),
