  # Anchor: spend n pmf to raise mitosis threshold (chemiosmotic CDK fortify / F1Fo gate seal).
  # Distinct from drive (pmf→lower thr), fortify (ATP→raise thr), brace (PCr→raise thr), harden (heat→raise thr),
  # prime/poise/ease (lower thr), synthase/pump/uncouple/set_threshold, mend (PCr→age), renew (pmf→age).
  # pmf pays; thr ceiling 1000. Yield sheds by take (pmf in yield).
  # energy/reserve/atp/heat/pcr untouched. Recomputes ready.
  # Usability: AGI spends proton-motive force to seal mitosis gate without burning ATP, PCr, or heat.
  # Returns amount anchored (threshold rise). Dead/zero/empty pmf/thr already 1000 → 0.
  METHOD anchor n
    GETF THIS alive
